# 🌧️ Rainfall Impact on Agricultural Productivity

### Power BI | Data Analytics | Data Visualization

## Project Overview

An interactive Power BI project analyzing historical rainfall patterns and agricultural productivity across Indian states from 1966 onwards.

## Objectives

* Analyze monthly monsoon rainfall.
* Compare state-wise crop productivity.
* Identify agricultural trends and regional variations.
* Explore historical rainfall patterns.

## Tools Used

* Microsoft Power BI Desktop
* Data Analytics
* Data Visualization

## Key Analysis

* Monthly rainfall (June–September).
* Barley yield across Indian states.
* Cotton production analysis.
* Castor productivity analysis.
* Interactive state and year filters.

## Key Findings

* July recorded the highest average rainfall (304.36 mm).
* August followed with 268.22 mm.
* Agricultural productivity varied across states and crop types.

